{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51992","headline":"辞诀友人诗（题拟） · 法琳","name":"辞诀友人诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"非意延非罪，离友复离亲。\n山川万里隔，方劳七尺身。\n游魂长去楚，分念独留秦。\n自匪相知者，谁怜死别人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法琳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51992.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51992","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}